            "name": "listAtpInsights",
            "description": {
              "content": "\n<div style=\"background-color: rgba(23, 162, 184, 0.15); border: 1px solid #17a2b8; border-left: 4px solid #17a2b8; padding: 12px; margin: 10px 0; border-radius: 4px; color: #17a2b8;\">\n  <strong>ℹ️ Rate Limit:</strong> This endpoint is rate limited to 90 requests per second.\n</div>\n\nRetrieves the allocations and reservations by ATP keys in your business.\n",
